<Base title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    I'm Ashley. I write here when something gets stuck in my head and reading
    one article about it doesn't get it unstuck.
  </p>
  <p>
    Right now that's orbital data centers — what it would actually take to run
    compute in space, worked out from the physics rather than from press
    releases. Before that it was other things, and it'll be other things again.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you find an error, I'd like to know. Corrections are the whole point of
    writing this in public.
  </p>
</Base>
